Z||000000||85fierogt||11-07-2001||09:10 PM||||allright when my fan picks up speed it clicks i think  its hittin something on the either the raiditor or the fan frame, its my second fan , i got it froma junk yard and it does the same thing, its annoying and sometimes it shakes teh whole car, not to mention the comments i recieve from the rice guys and pretty much everywhere, any ideas, have any of you guys heard of thise before, HELP ME...thanks <BR>-brad||||reg||1
